{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19205","headline":"和乐天洛下雪中宴集寄汴州李尚书 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天洛下雪中宴集寄汴州李尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛城无事足杯盘，风雪相和岁欲兰。\n树上因依见寒鸟，坐中收拾尽闲官。\n笙歌要请频何爽，笑语忘机拙更欢。\n遥想兔园今日会，琼林满眼映旗竿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}